Subject: [PATCH 5/6] AI assistant in the browser: ask the host page to run
 Claude Code

The web build had no backend ("desktop app only"). A host page that can run Claude Code
(the PdfCraft Chrome extension, through its native helper on the computer) now defines
window.pdfcraftClaude(prompt, system, onLine); the dialog sends the same prompt and system
prompt as claude -p on the desktop and streams the stream-json lines it gets back.
